flowchart TD
    Start([POST /api/v1/funding-invoices/batch]) --> ValidateCash
    ValidateCash{cashInOutId empty?}
    ValidateCash -->|Yes| ErrCash[400 Bad Request: cashInOutId required]
    ValidateCash -->|No| ValidateParams
    ValidateParams{subaccountIds provided?}
    ValidateParams -->|No| ErrParams[400 Bad Request: subaccount list required]
    ValidateParams -->|Yes| ValidateValues
    ValidateValues{All values valid?}
    ValidateValues -->|No| ErrValues[400 Bad Request: invalid parameter values]
    ValidateValues -->|Yes| Process
    Process[Begin Batch Processing]
    Process --> Loop{For each subaccountId}
    Loop --> Lookup[Lookup Subaccount in DB]
    Lookup --> Found{Subaccount found?}
    Found -->|No| RecordFail[Record failure for subaccountId]
    Found -->|Yes| Insert[INSERT FundingInvoice]
    Insert --> RecordSuccess[Record success with invoiceId]
    RecordFail --> Loop
    RecordSuccess --> Loop
    Loop --> Complete([201 Created: BatchInvoiceResultDto])
    ErrCash --> End([End])
    ErrParams --> End
    ErrValues --> End
    Complete --> End
